WEBVTT

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:14.560
I've never done it before, but I'll do it now.

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:17.390
I've got to be kidding...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:23.200
Shyness and bewilderment, should I add up those experiences?

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.240
Even if I've seen some things, I'll turn a blind eye to them.

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:27.960
They disappear with a flicker.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:33.100
I imagine the afterimage with an intense movie.

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:38.520
I unintentionally blurt out, "I kind of like you."

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:41.640
I have a temperature and a cold coming on.

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:44.150
It's no-no-normal.

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:48.900
When the contradictions come to an end, a white horse appears.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:51.650
How strange! How strange!

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:55.070
You look like the prince!

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:57.740
The regret from the kiss won't disappear.

00:00:57.740 --> 00:01:01.750
Why did you give it to me even though it's just puppy love?

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:05.400
We should start over at the least.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:08.250
It's not over. The kiss was passionate.

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:12.400
It was just too sudden, so what should we do?

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:16.040
Quickly, the horse from before!

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:19.900
Should we ride away? Just the two of us? And then leave it?

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:21.770
No, no, no.

00:01:21.770 --> 00:01:25.700
What I really want is for us to make

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:28.020
a secret plan!

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:55.800
Y-You're...

00:01:59.910 --> 00:02:01.760
You're a despicable man.

00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:05.770
For hurting my owner, I will bestow upon you certain death.

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:08.730
No!

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:09.730
Najimi!

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:09.730
Owner!

00:02:09.870 --> 00:02:11.100
Stop it, Yell.

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:16.570
Najimi, don't tell me you are this Akikan's owner?

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:19.760
T-That's...

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:22.070
This man must be killed.

00:02:22.940 --> 00:02:26.230
Yell? Why do you say such things?

00:02:26.230 --> 00:02:29.790
Kakeru-chan is Najimi's... Najimi's important...

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:42.390
Steel can.

00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:43.680
Melon-chan...

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:49.940
Kakeru!

00:02:52.470 --> 00:02:54.250
Hang in there!

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:55.230
Did you do this?

00:02:55.760 --> 00:02:59.960
Yes. This man is not suited to be an owner.

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:01.110
How dare you do this to Kakeru!

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:03.620
This time I will turn you into scrap!

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:06.850
This time I won't let you escape.

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:08.870
Owner, it is dangerous here. Please go-

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:12.210
Owner?! What are you doing?

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:20.590
So you were her owner.

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:24.030
That's not it. I just wanted to have-

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:24.800
Don't come any closer!

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:27.310
I'm sorry!

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:30.890
Don't make such a fuss.

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:33.570
You! Are you all right?

00:03:33.570 --> 00:03:36.060
It hurts like hell.

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:39.500
But!

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:43.160
As you can see, I am still alive. As I thought, I am immortal.

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:46.070
I am the invincible one. Really...

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:50.560
Kakeru! Hurry! Hurry and call an ambulance-

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:51.480
Don't call them!

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:56.270
Don't bring me to a hospital under any circumstances.

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:59.380
I can't! If we don't take care of this injury, you'll...

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:04.540
If they learn of this injury, Najimi will...

00:04:04.540 --> 00:04:07.750
So, under no circumstances...

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:08.710
Kakeru? Kakeru!

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:09.390
Kakeru? Kakeru!

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:14.190
How... Just how... How stupid are you?!

00:04:15.210 --> 00:04:17.650
Kakeru!

00:04:27.760 --> 00:04:30.110
It's my fault.

00:04:30.110 --> 00:04:33.580
Because of me, these kinds of things happened.

00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:36.080
You... pervert!

00:04:36.080 --> 00:04:37.670
You... pervert!

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:39.220
What are you doing?

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:41.670
Isn't it obvious? I'm throwing them away!

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:53.230
Bye bye, Kakeru.

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:09.960
How? How did these things happen?

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:13.250
Najimi just wanted to be with Kakeru...

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:14.710
With Kakeru...

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:19.340
Don't be sad, Owner.

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:20.710
Please give me the order.

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:24.580
The one who hurt you, I will...

00:05:26.420 --> 00:05:29.790
Owner, give me the order.

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:31.010
Owner... Owner!

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:32.220
Owner... Owner!

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:33.500
Owner... Owner...

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:34.470
Owner... Owner...

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:56.390
Thank you, Owner.

00:05:56.390 --> 00:05:58.120
Please give me the order.

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.290
Sorry.

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:04.300
It's no good. Najimi can't be together with Yell.

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:07.380
That's...

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:13.470
Am I lacking something?

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:16.640
Then I will correct it until you accept me.

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:20.700
If it's about Daichi Kakeru, next time I will surely-

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:21.810
Stop it!

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:28.430
That man is garbage.

00:06:28.430 --> 00:06:31.380
I'm sure he will continue to hurt you.

00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:33.950
Before that happens, I will...

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:39.270
It's enough.

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:40.420
Owner...

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:43.440
Please. Take that and leave here.

00:06:43.440 --> 00:06:44.340
I beg of you!

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:51.060
Owner!

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:01.740
Come out. Let us end this fight.

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:05.230
Melon-chan.

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:08.740
Is Kakeru-chan... Is Kakeru-chan all right?

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:12.040
Hurry up and go to where Kakeru is.

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:13.320
He is sleeping in his apartment.

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:19.040
We can no longer... stay with you.

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:22.370
Yell?

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:26.350
Let's go.

00:07:26.350 --> 00:07:27.390
Yes.

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:31.600
Yell!

00:07:37.610 --> 00:07:39.890
You're completely wrong.

00:07:40.260 --> 00:07:43.140
I'm not the one who broke the glass.

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:50.200
This... Did Melon do this?

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:54.260
I'm in my room. That means...

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:59.770
So she did what I asked her to do...

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:03.160
If I was asked something by the hospital, I wouldn't be able to give any explanation.

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:07.380
Hey, Melon! Come here a minute.

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:11.030
You did something right for a change.

00:08:11.030 --> 00:08:13.470
Your owner will give you a reward himself.

00:08:14.130 --> 00:08:15.700
Just kidding.

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:22.440
Come on. Where's your riposte?

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:25.440
If I'm talking to myself, wouldn't I look like an idiot?

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:31.320
Then again, I had been alone before you came, doing a one-man show.

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:38.480
It's not good for me to be so obsessed with punchline comedy by myself.

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:47.040
What? Did she go out somewhere?

00:08:57.080 --> 00:08:57.590
Melon?!

00:08:59.650 --> 00:09:01.020
Najimi.

00:09:01.740 --> 00:09:03.520
Kakeru-chan...

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:09.480
Steel can, where do you think you're headed?

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:11.280
Isn't it obvious?

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:15.030
A place that is wide open and has no people to disturb us.

00:09:15.030 --> 00:09:17.490
Then you and I can fight with all our strength.

00:09:19.390 --> 00:09:22.540
She decided on her own, that dented can.

00:09:24.060 --> 00:09:25.640
Kakeru-chan, where are you going?

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:28.460
Isn't it obvious? To bring back that idiot.

00:09:29.980 --> 00:09:33.280
Kakeru-chan, aren't you angry at Najimi?

00:09:33.280 --> 00:09:34.900
Angry?

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:37.430
Because I caused that injury...

00:09:38.350 --> 00:09:41.070
This was done by an Akikan.

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:43.560
Najimi told her to do so.

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:47.770
Because Kakeru-chan was on a date...

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:50.610
with Melon-chan instead of Najimi.

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:53.930
Hey, hey. That wasn't a date.

00:09:57.880 --> 00:10:00.400
Sorry. I apologize.

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:02.500
I'll make it up to you as much as you want later.

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:04.420
But now, finding Melon is-

00:10:04.420 --> 00:10:06.260
Kakeru-chan!

00:10:06.260 --> 00:10:09.200
Does Kakeru-chan love Melon-chan?

00:10:15.610 --> 00:10:17.090
I like her.

00:10:20.070 --> 00:10:22.410
About as much as I like you!

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:30.900
She is my friend, the same as you. You're both my important friends.

00:10:36.460 --> 00:10:38.720
Kakeru-chan...

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:46.450
Najimi will go with you.

00:10:47.940 --> 00:10:51.700
If I'm Kakeru-chan's friend, then you're also my friend.

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:53.170
Najimi.

00:10:53.870 --> 00:10:56.560
Besides, Yell also...

00:10:56.560 --> 00:10:58.930
Najimi was mistaken.

00:10:58.930 --> 00:11:03.060
Yet, even though Yell is Najimi's important friend...

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:05.640
And yet... Najimi...

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:10.640
If she's your friend, then she's also my friend.

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:14.400
Kakeru-chan...

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:21.400
You found them?

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:22.550
N-No...

00:11:22.550 --> 00:11:24.850
Where the heck did they go?

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:29.080
Hello?

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:32.310
It's a beautiful night, Najimi.

00:11:32.310 --> 00:11:33.330
Yuriri?

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:38.550
As a witch, I want to invite you to walk with me under the night's moon.

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:42.380
About that, Yuriri. Right now, Najimi has a very important...

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:43.640
Are you looking for someone?

00:11:44.840 --> 00:11:48.850
I felt it. My love, Najimi, is troubled.

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:52.350
I beg of you, Yuriri. If you know anything, tell me.

00:11:52.790 --> 00:11:56.310
The person you are searching for... now...

00:12:05.640 --> 00:12:08.910
I hate aluminum cans.

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:12.790
I also hate steel cans psychologically.

00:12:13.060 --> 00:12:14.080
But you know...

00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:18.170
You and I are probably alike.

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:21.170
That's probably true.

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:23.090
Let us start.

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:24.840
Yes.

00:12:33.410 --> 00:12:35.060
Isotonic sword!

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:39.190
Yubari barrier!

00:12:37.450 --> 00:12:39.190
Note: Yubari is a city in Hokkaido known for its melons.

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:56.030
Hey, hey. Why is there a traffic jam at this time?

00:12:56.030 --> 00:12:57.670
What do we do, Kakeru-chan?

00:13:08.210 --> 00:13:10.430
Who it is? At this time...

00:13:11.870 --> 00:13:16.130
Hello? Man, Nee-san, can't you sleep a little better?

00:13:16.130 --> 00:13:18.810
Hey, come over here quickly. The place is...

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:21.830
Huh, is it Kakeru? I'm really sleepy-

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:24.590
You're the only one I can rely on!

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:27.650
Is it possible that you're in a pinch?

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:32.060
Yeah, I'm in a pinch. So Gigolo, save me!

00:13:33.510 --> 00:13:34.540
Leave it to me!

00:13:35.850 --> 00:13:37.450
Melo-Melo Melon!

00:13:37.450 --> 00:13:38.670
Melo-Melo Melon!

00:13:40.650 --> 00:13:42.550
Such a simple attack...

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:45.220
won't hit me even once in 10,000 tries.

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:47.330
Melo-Melo Melon!

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:48.590
Melo-Melo Melon!

00:13:53.480 --> 00:13:53.970
It's useless.

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:00.310
Melon...

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:02.150
Kakeru-chan, are you all right?

00:14:05.400 --> 00:14:05.860
Here he is!

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:09.720
You're late, Gigolo.

00:14:09.720 --> 00:14:10.910
Gigolo-kun.

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:12.280
I'm not late.

00:14:14.060 --> 00:14:16.330
Do you think other people would come this late at night?

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:19.220
I believed that you would come.

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:24.650
Though you're plain, unpopular, and invisible to others,

00:14:24.650 --> 00:14:27.800
you aren't a man who would abandon friends who are in trouble.

00:14:28.780 --> 00:14:29.800
Absolutely.

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:32.640
Kakeru...

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:34.380
So then...

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:37.100
Najimi.

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:38.350
Yeah.

00:14:39.620 --> 00:14:42.680
W-Wait a minute. You'll be driving?

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:47.740
This kind of thing is nothing compared to controlling a woman's body.

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:49.230
A woman's body...

00:14:49.230 --> 00:14:51.490
Hold on tight, Najimi.

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:51.990
Yeah.

00:14:54.260 --> 00:14:55.720
Hey, Kakeru.

00:14:55.720 --> 00:14:58.620
Sorry for always calling you the supporting character.

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:02.710
You are not the supporting role...

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:05.420
You are my best foil.

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:07.340
Kakeru!

00:15:14.280 --> 00:15:17.470
How is it? How is it? I'm in perfect form!

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:22.530
I'm into it!

00:15:25.900 --> 00:15:28.530
Bye bye, Kakeru.

00:15:29.390 --> 00:15:33.830
What "Bye bye," idiot? I won't accept that sort of thing.

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:38.080
Now, right now, I will rush to where you are.

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:39.370
Kakeru-kun, up front!

00:15:47.650 --> 00:15:50.510
I only want to be loved and yet...

00:15:51.320 --> 00:15:53.800
For you, I will...

00:15:55.880 --> 00:15:56.550
A banana?

00:16:05.450 --> 00:16:08.470
Lately, vehicles sure have become inconvenient.

00:16:15.710 --> 00:16:16.970
You're...

00:16:18.390 --> 00:16:20.080
Wait, don't say it.

00:16:21.030 --> 00:16:24.120
If you call out my name, the magic will disappear.

00:16:34.850 --> 00:16:37.410
Kakeru-chan, that thing just now...

00:16:41.510 --> 00:16:44.070
This is becoming interesting!

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:51.270
Melo-Melo Melon!

00:16:51.270 --> 00:16:51.730
Melo-Melo Melon!

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:06.920
You lose, melon soda Akikan.

00:17:14.190 --> 00:17:15.540
This is...?!

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:18.450
I was waiting for this moment,

00:17:19.940 --> 00:17:21.280
right from the beginning.

00:17:21.280 --> 00:17:21.640
Damn it!

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:24.220
Colossal Melon!

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:32.920
How do you feel?

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:35.190
By the way, you can't come out from the inside.

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:42.160
N-No way!

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:53.710
What should I do? I wasted too much energy.

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:57.720
So I see that we're both close to our limits.

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:03.720
Let us finish the fight. This is all I've got...

00:18:10.510 --> 00:18:13.350
We absolutely will not fight.

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:17.400
Then what can I do?

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:20.240
Leave me alone.

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:22.070
Someone like me...

00:18:23.300 --> 00:18:25.950
Someone like me!

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:36.920
You! This is not a place to fight!

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:38.610
This...

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:41.220
Kakeru!

00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:44.760
This is the World Defense System Tournament's conference site...

00:18:45.380 --> 00:18:48.770
A place sometimes used to play baseball!

00:18:55.120 --> 00:18:56.730
Hey, Melon!

00:18:57.300 --> 00:19:02.160
Fighting won't make you precious or loved!

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:04.320
Kakeru...

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:06.480
You should have noticed it.

00:19:06.480 --> 00:19:08.700
You... You two...

00:19:09.890 --> 00:19:12.080
are not the unwanted Akikan!

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:16.930
That's because you two are loved,

00:19:16.930 --> 00:19:18.420
by Najimi and me.

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:21.180
We're...

00:19:21.860 --> 00:19:23.750
...loved...

00:19:23.750 --> 00:19:25.350
That's right, Yell.

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:30.270
Sorry. It's all Najimi's fault.

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:34.980
I'm really... sorry.

00:19:36.590 --> 00:19:37.770
Owner...

00:19:38.600 --> 00:19:42.200
Do you understand? This fight is over.

00:19:44.460 --> 00:19:45.910
You wanted me to love you, right?

00:19:48.510 --> 00:19:52.750
Come, Melon! Hold me tight, idiot!

00:19:56.020 --> 00:19:58.540
Kakeru!

00:20:01.490 --> 00:20:03.090
Kakeru!

00:20:10.910 --> 00:20:13.080
It seems like as soon as I relax, the injury begins hurting again!

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:17.210
Don't cause trouble for an injured person! Ouch!

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:19.270
If you can shout like this, that means you're okay.

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:20.590
It hurts! It hurts!

00:20:21.630 --> 00:20:22.570
Idiot...

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:22.570
You...

00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:26.910
Come back, Yell.

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:31.160
Najimi has decided to be together with Yell.

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:34.660
Owner...

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:38.130
The fight between Melon and Yell has ended.

00:20:38.970 --> 00:20:41.000
Looks like it was left undecided.

00:20:41.690 --> 00:20:43.330
Is that so?

00:20:43.330 --> 00:20:48.770
Otoya-san, as I thought, it's difficult to make them fight seriously.

00:20:48.770 --> 00:20:50.150
Airin-kun.

00:20:50.150 --> 00:20:51.060
It's Kizaki.

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:55.580
The Akikan Elect is just starting.

00:20:58.810 --> 00:21:01.400
As I thought, I'm a supporting character.

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:02.860
Amaji.

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:05.270
What's wrong?

